    "mostLikelyEtiology": "The most likely etiology is caffeine-induced paroxysmal supraventricular tachycardia (PSVT), possibly atrioventricular nodal reentrant tachycardia (AVNRT) or atrioventricular reentrant tachycardia (AVRT), given the abrupt onset, narrow QRS morphology, and history of similar episodes.",
